    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35566" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-spīro</span></b> , āre,
			v. n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To breathe everywhere</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R.
			157</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To blow constantly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venti perspirantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 45, 45, § 116</span></i>
			.</div>
